    </detaileddescription>
    <programlisting>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Injecting<sp/>Perturbations<sp/>{#callbacks}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>This<sp/>page<sp/>assumes<sp/>familiarity<sp/>with<sp/>the<sp/>basic<sp/>layout<sp/>and<sp/>API<sp/>usage<sp/>described<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>main<sp/>@ref<sp/>examples<sp/>page.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">One<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>most<sp/>intuitive<sp/>introductory<sp/>examples<sp/>to<sp/>simulating<sp/>network<sp/>dynamics<sp/>is<sp/>the<sp/>Kuramoto<sp/>model,<sp/>which<sp/>we<sp/>briefly<sp/>illustrated<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>[C<sp/>API<sp/>homepage](https://github.com/NonlinearC/NDXL/tree/main/NDXL).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>example<sp/>shown<sp/>here<sp/>includes<sp/>a<sp/>perturbation<sp/>of<sp/>one<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>oscillators<sp/>to<sp/>hint<sp/>at<sp/>the<sp/>discrete<sp/>callback<sp/>functionality<sp/>of<sp/>NDXL.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>Kuramoto<sp/>model<sp/>describes<sp/>the<sp/>phase<sp/>\f$\theta\f$<sp/>evolution<sp/>of<sp/>an<sp/>oscillator<sp/>with<sp/>eigenfrequency<sp/>\f$\omega\f$<sp/>as</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>\frac{d\theta_i}{dt}<sp/>=<sp/>\omega_i<sp/>+<sp/>\frac{1}{N_i}\displaystyle\sum_{j=1}^N{K_{ij}\sin{\left(\theta_j<sp/>-<sp/>\theta_i\right)}}.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Here,<sp/>\f$N_i\f$<sp/>is<sp/>the<sp/>degree<sp/>of<sp/>oscillator<sp/>\f$i\f$<sp/>(how<sp/>many<sp/>nearest<sp/>neighbours<sp/>it<sp/>has),<sp/>and<sp/>\f$K_{ij}\f$<sp/>is<sp/>the<sp/>coupling<sp/>strength<sp/>between<sp/>oscillators<sp/>\f$i\f$<sp/>and<sp/>\f$j\f$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">As<sp/>usual,<sp/>we<sp/>start<sp/>by<sp/>defining<sp/>the<sp/>dynamics<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>oscillators<sp/>(vertices).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Similar<sp/>to<sp/>@ref<sp/>network_traversal<sp/>functions,<sp/>the<sp/>edges<sp/>and<sp/>neighbouring<sp/>vertices<sp/>of<sp/>a<sp/>vertex<sp/>can<sp/>be<sp/>iterated<sp/>over<sp/>in<sp/>NDXL<sp/>using<sp/>its<sp/>@ref<sp/>vertex_traversal<sp/>functions.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>will<sp/>also<sp/>use<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlGetVertexDegree()<sp/>to<sp/>query<sp/>the<sp/>degree<sp/>of<sp/>each<sp/>oscillator.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;math.h&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>kuramoto(NDXLVertex*<sp/>oscillator,<sp/>double*<sp/>dtheta_i,<sp/>const<sp/>double*<sp/>theta_i,<sp/>double<sp/>time,<sp/>void*<sp/>params)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Pointer<sp/>conversion<sp/>to<sp/>extract<sp/>eigenfrequency<sp/>from<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>omega<sp/>=<sp/>*(double*)params;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Calculate<sp/>coupling<sp/>sum<sp/>by<sp/>iterating<sp/>over<sp/>only<sp/>the<sp/>vertices/edges<sp/>coupled<sp/>to<sp/>`oscillator`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>coupling<sp/>=<sp/>0.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>for<sp/>(NDXLEdge*<sp/>edge<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlGetVertexFirstEdge(oscillator);<sp/>edge;<sp/>edge<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlGetVertexNextEdge(oscillator,<sp/>edge))</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>K_ij<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlEdgeState(edge)[0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>theta_j<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlGetVertexNeighbourState(oscillator,<sp/>edge)[0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>coupling<sp/>+=<sp/>K_ij<sp/>*<sp/>sin(theta_j<sp/>-<sp/>theta_i[0]);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Write<sp/>derivative<sp/>in-place<sp/>and<sp/>indicate<sp/>function<sp/>success</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dtheta_i[0]<sp/>=<sp/>omega<sp/>+<sp/>coupling<sp/>/<sp/>ndxlGetVertexDegree(oscillator);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Next,<sp/>let<sp/>us<sp/>define<sp/>the<sp/>perturbation<sp/>callback<sp/>shown<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>paper,<sp/>which<sp/>set<sp/>the<sp/>phase<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>target<sp/>oscillator<sp/>to<sp/>\f$0\f$<sp/>at<sp/>\f$t=2.5\f$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Because<sp/>discrete<sp/>callbacks<sp/>are<sp/>called<sp/>after<sp/>each<sp/>successful<sp/>integration<sp/>step,<sp/>we<sp/>cannot<sp/>simply<sp/>alter<sp/>the<sp/>state<sp/>vector;<sp/>we<sp/>must<sp/>ensure<sp/>the<sp/>called<sp/>time<sp/>is<sp/>correct<sp/>first.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>perturbation(NDXLVertex*<sp/>oscillator,<sp/>double*<sp/>theta_i,<sp/>double<sp/>time,<sp/>void*<sp/>params)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(time<sp/>==<sp/>2.5)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>theta_i[0]<sp/>=<sp/>0.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>create<sp/>the<sp/>oscillators<sp/>next,<sp/>applying<sp/>the<sp/>callback<sp/>only<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>first<sp/>oscillator.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Assigning<sp/>the<sp/>callback<sp/>can<sp/>either<sp/>be<sp/>done<sp/>during<sp/>vertex<sp/>creation:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlInit();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>FILE*<sp/>f_output<sp/>=<sp/>fopen(&quot;kuramoto.csv&quot;,<sp/>&quot;w&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(!f_output)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>1;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>fprintf(f_output,<sp/>&quot;t,theta1,theta2,theta3,theta4\n&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLNetwork*<sp/>nwk<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateNetwork(f_output);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Eigenfrequencies<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>our<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`,<sp/>so<sp/>they<sp/>must<sp/>persist<sp/>in<sp/>memory</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>omega[4];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NDXLVertex*<sp/>oscillators[4];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Assign<sp/>to<sp/>only<sp/>the<sp/>first<sp/>oscillator</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>theta0<sp/>=<sp/>randdbl(-PI,<sp/>PI);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>omega[0]<sp/>=<sp/>randdbl(0.9,<sp/>1.1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>oscillators[0]<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>nwk,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&amp;theta0,r</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>kuramoto,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Assign<sp/>Kuramoto<sp/>dynamics</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>perturbation,<sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Assign<sp/>perturbation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&amp;omega[0]<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Eigenfrequency</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Do<sp/>the<sp/>rest<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>oscillators</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>for<sp/>(int<sp/>i<sp/>=<sp/>1;<sp/>i<sp/>&lt;<sp/>4;<sp/>i++)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>theta0<sp/>=<sp/>randdbl(-PI,<sp/>PI);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>omega[i]<sp/>=<sp/>randdbl(0.9,<sp/>1.1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>oscillators[i]<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>&amp;theta0,<sp/>1,<sp/>kuramoto,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>&amp;omega[i]);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Or<sp/>after<sp/>the<sp/>fact<sp/>using<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlSetVertexCallback()<sp/>:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>for<sp/>(int<sp/>i<sp/>=<sp/>0;<sp/>i<sp/>&lt;<sp/>4;<sp/>i++)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>theta0<sp/>=<sp/>randdbl(-PI,<sp/>PI);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>omega[i]<sp/>=<sp/>randdbl(0.9,<sp/>1.1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>oscillators[i]<sp/>=<sp/>ndxlCreateVertex(nwk,<sp/>&amp;theta0,<sp/>1,<sp/>kuramoto,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>&amp;omega[i]);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlSetVertexCallback(oscillators[0],<sp/>perturbation);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Defining<sp/>the<sp/>Topology<sp/>{#callbacks-topologies}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Before<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>simulate<sp/>our<sp/>Kuramoto<sp/>network,<sp/>we<sp/>need<sp/>the<sp/>edges<sp/>that<sp/>define<sp/>the<sp/>topology.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Failing<sp/>this,<sp/>the<sp/>oscillators<sp/>will<sp/>have<sp/>no<sp/>neighbours/edges<sp/>to<sp/>iterate<sp/>over,<sp/>and<sp/>even<sp/>worse,<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlGetVertexDegree()<sp/>will<sp/>return<sp/>\f$0\f$,<sp/>resulting<sp/>in<sp/>division<sp/>by<sp/>\f$0\f$!</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>will<sp/>create<sp/>a<sp/>ring<sp/>network<sp/>with<sp/>adjacency<sp/>matrix</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\begin{array}{|cccc|}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1<sp/>&amp;<sp/>0<sp/>\\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1<sp/>&amp;<sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1<sp/>\\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1<sp/>&amp;<sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1<sp/>\\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1<sp/>&amp;<sp/>1<sp/>&amp;<sp/>0<sp/>\\</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\end{array}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\f]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Although<sp/>there<sp/>are<sp/>eight<sp/>entries,<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>only<sp/>have<sp/>four<sp/>edges,<sp/>each<sp/>connecting<sp/>a<sp/>unique<sp/>pair<sp/>of<sp/>vertices.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>&quot;duplicate&quot;<sp/>entries<sp/>are<sp/>a<sp/>result<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>edges<sp/>being<sp/>undirected<sp/>i.e.,<sp/>if<sp/>oscillator<sp/>\f$i\f$<sp/>is<sp/>connected<sp/>to<sp/>\f$j\f$,<sp/>then<sp/>oscillator<sp/>\f$j\f$<sp/>is<sp/>also<sp/>connected<sp/>to<sp/>oscillator<sp/>\f$i\f$<sp/>via<sp/>the<sp/>same<sp/>edge.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Coupling<sp/>constant<sp/>K_ij<sp/>(made<sp/>identical<sp/>for<sp/>all<sp/>edges)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>K<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Define<sp/>topology</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateEdge(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>oscillators[0],<sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Source&quot;<sp/>vertex<sp/>(interchangeable<sp/>with<sp/>&quot;Destination&quot;<sp/>in<sp/>undirected<sp/>edge)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>oscillators[1],<sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Destination&quot;<sp/>vertex<sp/>(interchangeable<sp/>with<sp/>&quot;Source&quot;<sp/>in<sp/>undirected<sp/>edge)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&amp;K,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>State<sp/>vector</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Length<sp/>of<sp/>state<sp/>vector</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0.0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>delay<sp/>(see<sp/>@ref<sp/>dde)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Not<sp/>directed<sp/>(if<sp/>this<sp/>value<sp/>is<sp/>nonzero,<sp/>information<sp/>only<sp/>flows<sp/>from<sp/>&quot;Source&quot;<sp/>to<sp/>&quot;Destination&quot;<sp/>but<sp/>not<sp/>the<sp/>other<sp/>way<sp/>around)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>dynamics<sp/>(static<sp/>edge)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>noise</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>noise<sp/>channels<sp/>(must<sp/>be<sp/>NULL<sp/>if<sp/>noise<sp/>is<sp/>NULL)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Number<sp/>of<sp/>noise<sp/>channels<sp/>(must<sp/>be<sp/>0<sp/>if<sp/>noise<sp/>is<sp/>NULL)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>edge<sp/>callback</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>NULL<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>No<sp/>extra<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateEdge(oscillators[0],<sp/>oscillators[2],<sp/>&amp;K,<sp/>1,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateEdge(oscillators[1],<sp/>oscillators[3],<sp/>&amp;K,<sp/>1,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlCreateEdge(oscillators[2],<sp/>oscillators[3],<sp/>&amp;K,<sp/>1,<sp/>0.0,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>can<sp/>now<sp/>simulate<sp/>our<sp/>network<sp/>as<sp/>before;<sp/>however,<sp/>as<sp/>mentioned<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>@integration<sp/>section,<sp/>adaptive<sp/>methods<sp/>like<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlNetworkSimulateDopri()<sp/>do<sp/>not<sp/>guarantee<sp/>that<sp/>our<sp/>target<sp/>time<sp/>in<sp/>our<sp/>`perturbation`<sp/>callback<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>evaluated.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>therefore<sp/>have<sp/>two<sp/>options<sp/>for<sp/>ensuring<sp/>the<sp/>condition<sp/>`time<sp/>==<sp/>2.5`<sp/>eventually<sp/>evaluates<sp/>to<sp/>true:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Use<sp/>a<sp/>static<sp/>method<sp/>with<sp/>a<sp/>step<sp/>size<sp/>\f$h\f$<sp/>such<sp/>that<sp/>\f$2.5\mod<sp/>h=0\f$</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Use<sp/>the<sp/>time<sp/>stops<sp/>parameter<sp/>provided<sp/>by<sp/>adaptive<sp/>methods</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>first<sp/>option<sp/>works<sp/>in<sp/>theory,<sp/>however,<sp/>there<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>computational<sp/>issue,<sp/>namely,<sp/>floating<sp/>point<sp/>rounding.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Without<sp/>convoluting<sp/>the<sp/>details:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Computers<sp/>have<sp/>limited<sp/>precision<sp/>with<sp/>which<sp/>to<sp/>represent<sp/>decimal<sp/>numbers,<sp/>meaning<sp/>repeated<sp/>floating<sp/>point<sp/>addition<sp/>accumulates<sp/>rounding<sp/>errors</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>This<sp/>means<sp/>that,<sp/>for<sp/>a<sp/>hypothetical<sp/>\f$h=0.1\f$,<sp/>`time`<sp/>after<sp/>the<sp/>first<sp/>integration<sp/>step<sp/>would<sp/>be<sp/>\f$0+0.1=0.1\f$,<sp/>however,<sp/>after<sp/>the<sp/>third<sp/>step<sp/>it<sp/>would<sp/>be<sp/>\f$0.30000000000000004\f$</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>So<sp/>our<sp/>theory<sp/>of<sp/>using<sp/>\f$2.5\mod<sp/>h=0\f$<sp/>is<sp/>not<sp/>wrong,<sp/>but<sp/>in<sp/>programming<sp/>\f$0.3\neq0.30000000000000004\f$<sp/>-<sp/>the<sp/>same<sp/>might<sp/>hold<sp/>true<sp/>for<sp/>testing<sp/>`time<sp/>==<sp/>2.5`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>In<sp/>NDXL,<sp/>networks<sp/>and<sp/>agents<sp/>accumulate<sp/>time<sp/>differently.<sp/>In<sp/>a<sp/>static<sp/>method,<sp/>agents<sp/>use<sp/>repeated<sp/>addition,<sp/>which<sp/>magnifies<sp/>their<sp/>floating<sp/>point<sp/>error,<sp/>while<sp/>networks<sp/>calculate<sp/>their<sp/>current<sp/>time<sp/>as<sp/>their<sp/>start<sp/>time<sp/>plus<sp/>the<sp/>number<sp/>of<sp/>steps<sp/>multiplied<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>step<sp/>size.<sp/>This<sp/>makes<sp/>network<sp/>time<sp/>&quot;technically&quot;<sp/>more<sp/>accurate,<sp/>but<sp/>still<sp/>not<sp/>fully<sp/>reliable!</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>second<sp/>approach<sp/>therefore<sp/>appears<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>our<sp/>only<sp/>option.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>`_Tstops`<sp/>parameter,<sp/>like<sp/>a<sp/>state<sp/>vector,<sp/>is<sp/>an<sp/>array<sp/>containing<sp/>a<sp/>list<sp/>of<sp/>times<sp/>the<sp/>solver<sp/>must<sp/>evaluate;<sp/>the<sp/>array<sp/>must<sp/>be<sp/>sorted<sp/>and<sp/>lie<sp/>within<sp/>the<sp/>interval<sp/>\[@ref<sp/>ndxlGetNetworkTime(),<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlGetNetworkTime()<sp/>+<sp/>_Tspan\],<sp/>where<sp/>`_Tspan`<sp/>is<sp/>the<sp/>simulation<sp/>duration<sp/>(second<sp/>argument<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>simulate<sp/>function).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">We<sp/>must<sp/>also<sp/>provide<sp/>the<sp/>length<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>time<sp/>stops<sp/>vector,<sp/>which<sp/>in<sp/>this<sp/>case<sp/>is<sp/>\f$1\f$.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```c</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>main(int<sp/>argc,<sp/>char**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Define<sp/>the<sp/>time<sp/>stops<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>double<sp/>tstops<sp/>=<sp/>2.5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>@ref<sp/>ndxlNetworkSimulateRkck()<sp/>would<sp/>also<sp/>be<sp/>a<sp/>suitable<sp/>choice<sp/>here</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ndxlNetworkSimulateDopri(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>nwk,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>5.0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Simulation<sp/>duration;<sp/>the<sp/>time<sp/>stops<sp/>array<sp/>must<sp/>be<sp/>between<sp/>the<sp/>current<sp/>network<sp/>time<sp/>(which<sp/>starts<sp/>at<sp/>0)<sp/>and<sp/>that<sp/>time<sp/>plus<sp/>the<sp/>duration</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1e-6,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1e-3,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>&amp;tstops,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Time<sp/>stops<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>Length<sp/>of<sp/>time<sp/>stops<sp/>array</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>cb</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Our<sp/>output<sp/>verifies<sp/>the<sp/>perturbation<sp/>at<sp/>`time<sp/>==<sp/>2.5`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">![](@ref<sp/>kuramoto.png)</highlight></codeline>
